          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Results per hour: crawler -> router -> ingestor",
          "description": "crawler = results written to crawl_result (spider.heartbeat items_written); router = crawl records routed; ingestor = crawl results written to crawlerdb. All three should track each other. A drop that starts at one stage shows where volume is lost. Crawler and router lines need the logging added in this PR, so they are empty for data logged before deploy.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "gridPos": {
